This is the code to understand the graph in OpenVX 

Notes:
1. graph is for defining the pipeline 
2. internally graph manages the 
	. parallel execution 
	. Optimize execution 
	. Schedule Hardware 
	. In cpp the flow will be ordered but in OpenVX graph internally manages the independent node to execute in parallel



A graph without the Node will fail on vxVerifyGraph(gra)

This is the code with no obj(No Data Object, No Node)